entity-link\">Villages</a> generate in the Overworld.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/minecraft/overworld/creeper\" class=\"entity-link\">Creeper</a>\n            — Creepers spawn in the Overworld.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/minecraft/overworld/warden\" class=\"entity-link\">Warden</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/minecraft/overworld/warden\" class=\"entity-link\">Warden</a> appears in the deep dark of the Overworld.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/minecraft/survival\" class=\"entity-link\">Survival mode</a>\n            — Overworld is connected to <a href=\"/minecraft/survival\" class=\"entity-link\">Survival mode</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/minecraft/the-end/enderman\" class=\"entity-link\">Enderman</a>\n            — <a href=\"/minecraft/the-end/enderman\" class=\"entity-link\">Enderman</a> is connected to Overworld through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/minecraft/overworld/skeleton\" class=\"entity-link\">Skeleton</a>\n            — <a href=\"/minecraft/overworld/skeleton\" class=\"entity-link\">Skeleton</a> is connected to Overworld through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/minecraft/overworld/diamonds\" class=\"entity-link\">Diamonds</a>\n            — <a href=\"/minecraft/overworld/diamonds\" class=\"entity-link\">Diamonds</a> is connected to Overworld through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit t